  "details": "Directions: Make sure you have 120 fps (not sure if necessary)\n\n1. Open VRChat and stay on the main menu\n\n2. Scroll up and down slowly across the main menu\n\nThe menu seems to jitter or stutter while scrolling through some parts of the menu.\n\nIt could be the images reloading as you scroll up and down causing it to lag or stutter, especially the 'Hot Worlds' sections.\n\nIt could also be an issue if iOS is having trouble identifying if it should use 120 or 60 fps while scrolling though very unlikely.\n\niPhone 13 Pro Max\n\nVersion: 2024.3.2 (346)\n\niOS Version: iOS 18.1 (Beta 5)",
